OL,3,GNEWSAPenzance trio to play Last Post
OL,4,Afor Remembrance
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree members of a silver band are
OL,7,Fpreparing for a very special
OL,8,Fperformance on Remembrance Sunday.
OL,10,FIt will be the first time three
OL,11,Ftrumpeters have come together to play
OL,12,FThe Last Post in Penzance, Cornwall,
OL,13,Fand there has been a special effort to
OL,14,Fmake it a multi-generational affair.
OL,16,FArthur, who is 15, Yves Giebens, 53,
OL,17,Fand Gwyn Williams, 77, have all been
OL,18,Frehearsing hard to make sure they are
OL,19,Fnote perfect.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
