OL,3,GNEWSAPenzance trio to play Last Post
OL,4,Afor Remembrance
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe youngest member of the trio from
OL,7,FPenzance Silver Band said: "I think it
OL,8,Fappeals to all generations because we
OL,9,Fall feel grief and remorse for World
OL,10,FWar One and World War Two."
